  "name": "lean",
  "description": "Lean is an interactive theorem prover based on the Calculus of Inductive Constructions, facilitating formalized mathematics and verified software development through a robust dependent type system. The codebase implements a high-performance C++ kernel, a sophisticated elaborator supporting type classes, and an extensible tactic framework for automated and interactive proof construction. It features an integrated equations compiler for complex recursion and automated reasoning components including congruence closure and e-matching.",
